        "content": "<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>not pictured: a failed MWE attempt</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>theorem helpful? ⦃X Y : Kleisli T⦄ (f : X ⟶ Y)\n  (g)\n  (h : g = (adj\n  T).counit.app X ≫ (𝟭 (Kleisli T)).map f ) :\n  g = (adj\n  T).counit.app X ≫ (𝟭 (Kleisli T)).map f := by\n  conv_rhs =&gt;\n    equals (CategoryStruct.comp ((adj T).counit.app X) ((Functor.id (Kleisli T)).map\n        f)) =&gt;\n      rw [← (adj T).counit.naturality]\n  exact h\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
